* Sun Aug 02 2026 Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com> - 1.18.11-0
- Own hicolor icon theme directories to fix OBS "directories not owned" build failure
- Fix unresolvable Fedora package names in Requires (gtk3, nss, alsa-lib,
